                            <span class="badge bg-info-subtle text-info border border-info-subtle px-2 py-1">
                                <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge me-1"></i>Live / Real-Time
                            </span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold text-muted" style="font-size: 0.78rem;">Powered by Active Plan Cache</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mb-1 text-muted">
                            Directly inspects compiled queries currently resting in SQL Server's active memory (RAM).
                        </p>
                        <ul class="mb-0 ps-3 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
                            <li><strong>Always available:</strong> Works on every database without needing any setup or extra storage.</li>
                            <li><strong>Right now:</strong> Shows cumulative consumption since the server started or cache was cleared.</li>
                            <li><strong>Resets on restart:</strong> Cleared whenever the database service restarts or memory is flushed.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer border-top py-2 px-3" style="border-color: var(--app-border) !important;">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary px-3" @onclick="() => _showModeHelpModal = false">
                        Got it
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
